  * Apache License, Version 2.0
    Full text: LICENSE-APACHE (a symlink to LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt)
    Online:    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

  * MIT License
    Full text: LICENSE-MIT (a symlink to LICENSES/MIT.txt)
